{"agent_id":"pp3g-Pvfl-documentation-update-for-issue-140-wave-a3-of-the-e5a5","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T05:42:01.123896529Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"f07207cd-d69f-4856-93e4-7db9b3d7a922","comment_uuid":"d64d60b4-ce95-4795-ae9d-cfe27e51f0e9","author":"pp3g-Pvfl-documentation-update-for-issue-140-wave-a3-of-the-e5a5","content":"Plan: Documentation update, all doc edits, no code.\n(1) .crosslink/knowledge/model-discipline.md — add failure-discrimination rule: on a stalled agent check ~/.local/share/opencode/log/opencode.log for the error signature; rate limit = 'Provider rate limit exceeded' / 429; hang = outgoing stream with no response and no error. Include laguna #129 evidence (session ses_03aa886c0ffeXKFRLMhDrbTNyd: last event 02:01:30 'message=stream modelID=laguna-s-2.1-free' outgoing, never completed, zero level=ERROR entries; historical rate-limit incidents logged 'Provider rate limit exceeded'; ling/big-pickle/nemotron completed fine in the same window).\n(2) Same file — add 'Request Timeout Configuration' subsection: file = ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json (USER-LEVEL GLOBAL, explicitly NOT in-repo); schema = provider.<id>.options.{timeout,headerTimeout,chunkTimeout} (NOT provider.<id>.timeout); current values = timeout 3600000ms, headerTimeout 300000ms, chunkTimeout 300000ms for providers 'opencode' and 'opencode-go' (verified live in the config); rationale = 5-min chunkTimeout exceeds worst-case legitimate inter-chunk gap for deepseek-v4-* reasoning while catching 10+min silent-stream hangs, kept above 120s heartbeat throttle. Distinguish from playbook §5.3 task-matched timeout (agent runtime) — this is the per-API-request timeout.\n(3) .crosslink/knowledge/agent-orchestration-playbook.md — add THREE operational rules: (a) HUB-REFS GROUND-TRUTH: hub agent refs (refs/heads/crosslink/agents/<id>/events.log) are ground truth, NOT local main-repo SQLite DB; NEVER run 'crosslink sync' in main repo to refresh visibility (caused June rollback); safe verify = git show/log on hub refs (see #125); (b) STANDING WORKFLOW: while any agent runs, EVERY orchestrator turn ends with a brief Agent Status note (state, time-in, last signal) even if unchanged; run crosslink kickoff cleanup after each dispatch wave (assess STALE with --dry-run --force, preserve work before removing); (c) reference the Phase 1 watcher §6.4 already added.\n(4) Mirror all changes to tripn-astro (/home/claude-code/projects/tripn-astro/.crosslink/knowledge/model-discipline.md — file must be created there; agent-orchestration-playbook.md — update) per §5.5 two-repo sync; commit there on a feature branch (operator-gated).\n(5) Commit ASES changes with ref #140. Do NOT close #140. Do NOT push.","created_at":"2026-08-03T05:42:01.117780672Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:JV8KosHe2wWKcWdhzFGpKwwl0jZdtze6/ratCxcRb1U","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgf/9lPDUfLtnQ4Qu2hBJd7E0YHmgVq1LTN6Dtrf8D2dMAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAMVm0mBLpjhb9d8yfdh24JZ5BwAO7rMxoAHSfvcf7DRMxxPkIkqYiPUj31GOK4x6UDeJBwvFR7enZ554FKnawAw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:JV8KosHe2wWKcWdhzFGpKwwl0jZdtze6/ratCxcRb1U","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgf/9lPDUfLtnQ4Qu2hBJd7E0YHmgVq1LTN6Dtrf8D2dMAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNzPngj3EIcY/nzb09zmTrczPWsXdL4sLhYrom90d3/ftPVk9a3+HTX3Ec0D3LoNZOdAhSdYASCV8uT4z6NVGww="}
